                  </a>
                  </p>

                  <p class="p-text-info-modal-contact text-black"><i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt text-red mrb5"></i><a href="https://goo.gl/maps/Z1fT2KWcT8HABc1w7">578603 Ruta 1
                    Km 18 - Capiatá - Paraguay</a></p>

                  <p class="p-text-info-modal-contact text-black"><i class="fas fa-phone text-red mrb5"></i>
                  <span class="text-red">Atenci&oacute;n al Cliente</span>
                  <a href="tel:+595215889000" class="">+59521 588 9000</a>
                  </p>

                  <p class="p-text-info-modal-contact text-black"><i class="fas fa-envelope text-red mrb5"></i><a href="mailto:cavallaro@cavallaro.com.py">
